  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in game-day comfort with the personalized Basketball Player Blanket by Jeminise. Perfect for basketball lovers, this lightweight yet cozy blanket features a realistic photography design of a basketball player, customizable with your own name and jersey number. Whether you are relaxing on the sofa, watching your favorite team on TV, or heading out for a picnic, this ultra-soft blanket provides the perfect layer of warmth for all seasons.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your blanket with up to two text inputs for a custom name and jersey number.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Materials:</strong> Crafted with two polyester fabric layers, available in super-soft Fleece or plush Sherpa fabric.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from four sizes to suit your needs: Small (40x30 in), Medium (50x40 in), Large (60x50 in), and X-Large (80x60 in).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Functional and decorative, ideal for napping, reading on the couch, traveling, camping, or bedroom bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on a low-heat or air-dry cycle to stay fluffy.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Name and Number (2 text inputs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
